    {
     "kind": "text",
     "x": 326,
     "y": 430,
     "w": 412,
     "h": 100,
     "text": "A configuration change meant to tighten abuse limits was applied with the wrong unit. For 47 minutes, legitimate traffic in the EU region was throttled and 18.4% of chat completion requests returned errors at the peak. A rollback restored service and no data was lost.",
     "family": "Inter",
     "size": 12.5,
     "weight": 400,
     "color": "#1E1B18",
     "lineHeight": 1.55
    },
    {
     "kind": "text",
     "x": 326,
     "y": 546,
     "w": 240,
     "h": 14,
     "text": "Root cause",
     "family": "IBM Plex Mono",
     "size": 10,
     "weight": 600,
     "color": "#1E1B18",
     "letterSpacing": 1.6,
     "upper": true
    },
    {
     "kind": "rect",
     "x": 326,
     "y": 568,
     "w": 412,
     "h": 100,
     "fill": "#F1E8DA"
    },
    {
     "kind": "rect",
     "x": 326,
     "y": 568,
     "w": 4,
     "h": 100,
     "fill": "#B23A1E"
    },
    {
     "kind": "text",
     "x": 346,
     "y": 578,
     "w": 374,
     "h": 82,
     "text": "The new token-bucket limit was defined per gateway node, while the config schema expects a per-tenant value. Validation checked only the type, so a limit 48 times stricter than intended passed review and CI.",
     "family": "Inter",
     "size": 12.5,
     "weight": 400,
     "color": "#1E1B18",
     "lineHeight": 1.5
